                     <widget class="QPushButton" name="btnSigSave">
                      <property name="minimumSize">
                       <size>
                        <width>150</width>
                        <height>32</height>
                       </size>
                      </property>
                      <property name="text">
                       <string>Save Signatories</string>
                      </property>
                     </widget>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                     <widget class="QPushButton" name="btnSigRevert">
                      <property name="minimumSize">
                       <size>
                        <width>110</width>
                        <height>32</height>
                       </size>
                      </property>
                      <property name="text">
                       <string>Revert</string>
                      </property>
                     </widget>
                    </item>
                   </layout>
                  </item>
                  <item>
                   <spacer name="sigVSpacer">
                    <property name="orientation">
                     <enum>Qt::Orientation::Vertical</enum>
                    </property>
                    <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
                     <size>
                      <width>20</width>
                      <height>40</height>
                     </size>
                    </property>
                   </spacer>
                  </item>
                 </layout>
                </widget>
               </item>
               <item>
                <widget class="QGroupBox" name="grpDatabase">
                 <property name="title">
                  <string>Database</string>
                 </property>
                 <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="databaseOuter">
                  <item>
                   <widget class="QLabel" name="lblDatabaseHelp">
                    <property name="text">
                     <string>Installing a newer version of the program upgrades the database by itself the first time it runs. Before that happens -- and before any new program version runs for the first time -- a complete copy is saved as a restore point, so an update that turns out to be a mistake can be undone.</string>
                    </property>
                    <property name="wordWrap">
                     <bool>true</bool>
                    </property>
                   </widget>
                  </item>
                  <item>
                   <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="databaseButtons">
                    <item>
                     <widget class="QPushButton" name="btnRestorePoints">
                      <property name="minimumSize">
                       <size>
                        <width>190</width>
                        <height>30</height>
                       </size>
                      </property>
                      <property name="toolTip">
                       <string>List the saved copies of the database and roll back to one of them.</string>
                      </property>
                      <property name="text">
                       <string>Restore Points...</string>
                      </property>
                     </widget>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                     <spacer name="databaseBtnSpacer">
                      <property name="orientation">
                       <enum>Qt::Orientation::Horizontal</enum>
                      </property>
                      <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
                       <size>
                        <width>40</width>
                        <height>20</height>
                       </size>
                      </property>
                     </spacer>
                    </item>
                   </layout>
                  </item>
                  <item>
                   <widget class="QLabel" name="lblDatabaseState">
                    <property name="text">
                     <string/>
                    </property>
                    <property name="wordWrap">
                     <bool>true</bool>
                    </property>
                   </widget>
                  </item>
                 </layout>
                </widget>
               </item>
               <item>
                <widget class="QGroupBox" name="grpArchive">
                 <property name="title">
                  <string>Data Archive</string>
                 </property>
                 <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="archiveOuter">
                  <item>
                   <widget class="QLabel" name="lblArchiveHelp">
                    <property name="text">
                     <string>A completed year is moved into its own archive file from 15 January onward, covering 1 January to 31 December of that year. The delay leaves room for late December imports. A full backup is taken before anything is removed, and rows are only removed once every one of them has been confirmed present in the archive.</string>
                    </property>
                    <property name="wordWrap">
                     <bool>true</bool>
                    </property>
                   </widget>
                  </item>
                  <item>
                   <widget class="QCheckBox" name="chkArchiveAuto">
                    <property name="text">
                     <string>Archive completed years automatically at start-up</string>
                    </property>
                   </widget>
                  </item>
                  <item>
                   <widget class="QCheckBox" name="chkArchivePurge">
                    <property name="toolTip">
                     <string>Untick to make archiving a pure copy. The archive files are still written and still viewable, but the live database keeps every year and will keep growing.</string>
                    </property>
                    <property name="text">
                     <string>Remove archived records from the live database</string>
                    </property>
                   </widget>
                  </item>
                  <item>
                   <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="archiveButtons">
                    <item>
                     <widget class="QPushButton" name="btnViewArchives">
                      <property name="minimumSize">
                       <size>
                        <width>170</width>
                        <height>30</height>
                       </size>
                      </property>
                      <property name="text">
                       <string>View Archived Years...</string>
                      </property>
                     </widget>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                     <widget class="QPushButton" name="btnArchiveNow">
                      <property name="minimumSize">
                       <size>
                        <width>150</width>
                        <height>30</height>
                       </size>
                      </property>
                      <property name="toolTip">
                       <string>Runs the same archiving step start-up would, for every year that is already eligible.</string>
                      </property>
                      <property name="text">
                       <string>Archive Now...</string>
                      </property>
                     </widget>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                     <spacer name="archiveBtnSpacer">
                      <property name="orientation">
                       <enum>Qt::Orientation::Horizontal</enum>
                      </property>
                      <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
                       <size>
                        <width>40</width>
                        <height>20</height>
                       </size>
                      </property>
                     </spacer>
                    </item>
                   </layout>
                  </item>
                  <item>
                   <widget class="QLabel" name="lblArchiveState">
                    <property name="text">
                     <string/>
                    </property>
                    <property name="wordWrap">
                     <bool>true</bool>
                    </property>
                   </widget>
                  </item>
                 </layout>
                </widget>
               </item>
               <item>
                <widget class="QGroupBox" name="grpReportEditor">
                 <property name="title">
                  <string>Report Template</string>
                 </property>
                 <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="reportEditorOuter">
                  <item>
                   <widget class="QPushButton" name="btnOpenReportEditor">
                    <property name="minimumSize">
                     <size>
                      <width>0</width>
                      <height>30</height>
                     </size>
                    </property>
                    <property name="toolTip">
                     <string>Opens the CSC Form 48 layout in the Report Designer -- column widths, fonts, the header logos, and the RELEASED stamp artwork are all placed there directly. Requires developer mode.</string>
                    </property>
                    <property name="text">
                     <string>Open Report Editor...</string>
                    </property>
                   </widget>
                  </item>
                  <item>
                   <widget class="QLabel" name="lblReportEditorHelp">
                    <property name="text">
                     <string>Changes apply to every future print and preview. Unlock developer mode below first (Console Command: &quot;godmode 1&quot;).</string>
                    </property>
                    <property name="wordWrap">
                     <bool>true</bool>
                    </property>
                   </widget>
                  </item>
                 </layout>
                </widget>
               </item>
               <item>
                <widget class="QGroupBox" name="grpDeveloper">
                 <property name="title">
                  <string>Developer</string>
                 </property>
                 <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="devOuter">
                  <item>
                   <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="devConsoleRow">
                    <item>
                     <widget class="QLabel" name="lblConsoleCmd">
                      <property name="text">
                       <string>Console Command :</string>
                      </property>
                     </widget>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                     <widget class="QLineEdit" name="txtConsoleCmd">
                      <property name="minimumSize">
                       <size>
                        <width>260</width>
                        <height>28</height>
                       </size>
                      </property>
                      <property name="maximumSize">
                       <size>
                        <width>360</width>
                        <height>28</height>
                       </size>
                      </property>
                      <property name="placeholderText">
                       <string>Type a command and press Enter</string>
                      </property>
                     </widget>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                     <widget class="QLabel" name="lblConsoleState">
                      <property name="text">
                       <string/>
                      </property>
                     </widget>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                     <spacer name="devConsoleSpacer">
                      <property name="orientation">
                       <enum>Qt::Orientation::Horizontal</enum>
                      </property>
                      <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
                       <size>
                        <width>40</width>
                        <height>20</height>
                       </size>
                      </property>
                     </spacer>
                    </item>
                   </layout>
                  </item>
                  <item>
                   <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="devOptionsLayout">
                    <property name="leftMargin">
                     <number>0</number>
                    </property>
                    <property name="topMargin">
                     <number>6</number>
                    </property>
                    <property name="rightMargin">
                     <number>0</number>
                    </property>
                    <property name="bottomMargin">
                     <number>0</number>
                    </property>
                    <item>
                     <layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="devRelDateRow">
                      <item>
                       <widget class="QCheckBox" name="chkOverrideRelease">
                        <property name="toolTip">
                         <string>Prints this date in the RELEASED stamp of the CSC Form 48 instead of today's date. The TIME in the stamp stays the real time of printing.</string>
                        </property>
                        <property name="text">
                         <string>Override release date</string>
                        </property>
                       </widget>
                      </item>
                      <item>
                       <widget class="QDateEdit" name="dateOverrideRelease">
                        <property name="enabled">
                         <bool>false</bool>
                        </property>
                        <property name="minimumSize">
                         <size>
                          <width>160</width>
                          <height>28</height>
                         </size>
                        </property>
                        <property name="displayFormat">
                         <string>MMMM d, yyyy</string>
                        </property>
                        <property name="calendarPopup">
                         <bool>true</bool>
                        </property>
                       </widget>
                      </item>
                      <item>
                       <spacer name="devRelDateSpacer">
                        <property name="orientation">
                         <enum>Qt::Orientation::Horizontal</enum>
                        </property>
                        <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
                         <size>
                          <width>40</width>
                          <height>20</height>
                         </size>
                        </property>
                       </spacer>
                      </item>
                     </layout>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                     <widget class="QCheckBox" name="chkAllowTimeEdit">
                      <property name="toolTip">
                       <string>Makes the four time columns of the Daily Time Record table editable. Edits are written straight to the biometric log and cannot be undone.</string>
                      </property>
                      <property name="text">
                       <string>Allow time modification</string>
                      </property>
                     </widget>
                    </item>
                    <item>
                     <widget class="QLabel" name="lblDevWarn">
                      <property name="text">
                       <string>Editing a time rewrites the raw biometric record for that employee. The change is permanent and leaves no trace that the punch was altered. Developer mode itself is never saved: it is off again the next time the program starts.</string>
                      </property>
                      <property name="wordWrap">
                       <bool>true</bool>
                      </property>
                     </widget>
                    </item>
                   </layout>
                  </item>
                  <item>
                   <spacer name="devVSpacer">
                    <property name="orientation">
                     <enum>Qt::Orientation::Vertical</enum>
                    </property>
                    <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
                     <size>
                      <width>20</width>
                      <height>20</height>
                     </size>
                    </property>
                   </spacer>
                  </item>
                 </layout>
                </widget>
               </item>
               <item>
                <spacer name="settingsTailSpacer">
                 <property name="orientation">
                  <enum>Qt::Orientation::Vertical</enum>
                 </property>
                 <property name="sizeType">
                  <enum>QSizePolicy::Policy::Expanding</enum>
                 </property>
                 <property name="sizeHint" stdset="0">
                  <size>
                   <width>20</width>
                   <height>0</height>
                  </size>
                 </property>
                </spacer>
               </item>
              </layout>
             </widget>
            </widget>
           </item>
          </layout>
         </widget>
        </widget>
       </item>
